    "basis": "Control window of the XP4 sixteen-channel countdown timer bank. X-T3 5.11 kernel 0x5963c/0x59674/0x59594/0x59c80 programs it; 0x106e8b0 routes channel n through interrupt row 0x13e4f94[n] = 0x10 + n of table 0x13e6454 ({0x29 + n, 0xc0, 3, 1}). The model pulses an edge per expiry because nothing acknowledges the timer; that the line is an edge is inferred, not measured."
